11
00:59:31,764 --> 00:59:37,764
Tickled is a 2016 New Zealand documentary about "competitive endurance tickling" and
videos featuring it, and the practices of those producing the videos.

12
01:04:56,470 --> 01:05:02,470
It is directed by David Farrier and Dylan Reeve.

13
01:10:21,176 --> 01:10:27,176
The film explores possible legal and ethical issues with certain individuals making
the videos, and has itself been the subject of legal challenges.

14
01:15:45,882 --> 01:15:51,882
A follow-up special, The Tickle King, aired on HBO in February 2017.

15
01:21:10,588 --> 01:21:16,588
The film explores themes of journalist, sports,
secret identity, fetish, fetishism.

16
01:26:35,294 --> 01:26:41,294
The tone is thought_provoking.
